name prelim2e
category Package
revision 77682
shortdesc Allows the marking of preliminary versions of a document
longdesc Puts text below the normal page content (the default text marks
longdesc the document as draft and puts a timestamp on it). Can be used
longdesc together with e.g. the vrsion, rcs and rcsinfo packages. Uses
longdesc the everyshi package and can use the scrtime package from the
longdesc koma-script bundle.
